<li>Within the Plantation Household: Black and White Women of the Old South, series on Gender and American Culture, Chapel Hill, NC: University of North Carolina Press, 1988.</li>
<li>Feminism Without Illusions: A Critique of Individualism, University of North Carolina Press, 1991.</li>
